Unaweza kutekeleza algorithm ya bubble sort katika Java ili kupanga array ya nambari nzima kwa kutumia msimbo ufuatao:

```java
public static void bubbleSort(int[] arr) {
    for (int i = 0; i < arr.length - 1; i++) {
        for (int j = 0; j < arr.length - i - 1; j++) {
            if (arr[j] > arr[j + 1]) {
                int temp = arr[j];
                arr[j] = arr[j + 1];
                arr[j + 1] = temp;
            }
        }
    }
}

public static void main(String[] args) {
    int[] arr = { 10, 2, 3, 5, 7 };
    bubbleSort(arr);
    System.out.println(Arrays.toString(arr));
